    "UI accepts only acknowledged and freshly read-back value/newer revision; invalid/stale/lost outcomes disable writing until an explicit read, never replay",
    "New reads, reconnect, inspector and close retire late values; restricted inspectors do not read or expose the global default",
    "Read Only, Ask before actions and Full access describe existing Pi policies; current-session /permission and experimental Auto remain unavailable"
  ],
